<h2>Can this tell me which app measures cortisol accurately?</h2>
<p>No. Comparing interfaces does not validate hormone measurements. If that is your goal, read <a href="/cortisol/test/">what at-home cortisol testing involves</a>. For a separate record of sleep and how you feel, use the <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/">free stress and sleep journal</a>.</p>
